ht|n|at|^*GA1,1.  6-5 hands are very rare.^*N|
                  
ht|o|at|^*GA2,2.  It is often hard to keep track of the spots below the 10^*N|
                  
ht|p|at|^*GA3,3.  With 6-4 you want to play in a suit^*N|
                  
ht|q|at|^*GA4,4.  Even top experts say, "But who knows"^*N|
                  
ht|r|at|^*GA5,5.  Do you know what Favorable is in Bridge?^*N|
                  
ht|s|at|^*GA6,    ^*N|


