mb|2C|mb|P|mb|2N|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|3S|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|3@S is forcing. Once you bid over a 2N invitation, you are accepting the invitation and looking for the best game. 2N by North is natural probably a slight overbid but invitational to 3N.|
