pc|D4|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I have 5 clubs, a diamond, and 2 spades off the top. I can get 2 spade ruffs (if trumps are 2-1). That comes to 10 tricks and if spades are no worse than 4-2 I will get a long spade.|
