mb|1N|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|2D|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|The 2@D call is a good one. With 6-4 you want to play in a suit. Given my 1N bid it is likely I have at least 2 diamonds. The diamond suit in North hand is good enough to play even if I have a singleton.|
