UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|As it turns out, in NT, assuming a club lead, North takes 1 club, 1 heart, 5 diamonds, and 2 spades for 9 tricks because the opponents can only cash 3 club tricks and a diamond.|
PG| ***** 54 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|However, 2@D is still a better bid, and I would not want to be in 3N.|
PG| ***** 55 ***** |


