UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I might get to 4@S with the EW hands, although with 4-1 clubs, it is hard to make.|
PG| ***** 78 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^^B@2^*BWest: ^*NWhat do I need to make a ^*BMaximal Double^*n?|
PG| ***** 79 ***** |


cp|8|AT|^^
^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|A hand where you would invite to 4@S (e.g. 9-11 or so). Your hand with 8 HCP, a fit in clubs, singleton heart (worth 2 or 3), and quality spades clearly is good enough to make a ^*BMaximal Double^*n here.|
PG| ***** 80 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Had I passed, I think West had a 3@S call anyway. Further, it is possible to make 4@S but difficult. All in all an  interesting board to bid and play.|
PG| ***** 81 ***** |


