mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|P?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|It is not clear what West should bid. Pass is possible. On the other hand, even if partner has nothing, West is strong enough to consider bidding 3@S. It would not be unreasonable.|
