UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I was asked what were my choices after North bid 2@C. I bid 2@H because it was barely possible we had game in hearts. On the other hand, I could have bid 3@C or even 2@S (limit raise in clubs). 3@C was the best spot IMHO.
|
